  "html": "<p>Abaddon is one of the toughest bosses in the entire game.  He is protected by three melee guards and a caster/healer, all of whom can be resurrected.  If you try to take the guards out before the Boss, he will just resurrect them.  It is next to impossible for a middle level solo player to defeat them.  A strong group with varying skills can do it.  For tips on fighting Abaddon, check out the <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Abaddon Boss Guide</a>.\n</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<p><b>Abaddon</b> (<a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>) Level 40-100\n</p><p>Skills:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Hellfire (fire damage, area spell)\n</li><li>Fireball (fire damage)\n</li><li>Resurrect Caster\n</li><li>Flame Prison (slowdown during 10secs)\n</li><li>Flammable (Curse- fire damage resistance reduced by 40, 15 second duration)\n</li><li>Ressurect Guard\n</li></ul>\n<p>Resistances:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Low Poison Resist\n</li><li>Immune against Fire\n</li><li>No Ice Resist\n</li><li>Good Shadow Resist\n</li><li>No Divine Resist\n</li></ul>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:127px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" title=\"Abaddon - Calling down a rain of fire.\"><img alt=\"Abaddon - Calling down a rain of fire.\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"290\" src=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" width=\"125\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Abaddon - Calling down a rain of fire.</div></div></div>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Support\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Support</span></h2>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<a name=\"Abaddon.27s_Guard_.28Caster-Healer.29\"></a><h5> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Abaddon's Guard (Caster-Healer)</span></h5>\n<p><b>Class: </b>Hero<br/>\nSkills:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Shadow Bolt (shadow damage)\n</li><li>Heal\n</li></ul>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:127px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Healer.jpg\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard Healer\"><img alt=\"Abaddon's Guard Healer\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"278\" src=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Healer.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Healer.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Abaddon's Guard Healer</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<a name=\"Abaddon.27s_Guard_.28Melee.29\"></a><h5> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Abaddon's Guard (Melee)</span></h5>\n<p><b>Class: </b>Hero<br/>\nSkill:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Hamstring (5 second duration)\n</li><li>Holy Roller ( knock down )\n</li></ul>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Melee.jpg\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard Melee\"><img alt=\"Abaddon's Guard Melee\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"176\" src=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Melee.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Abaddon's_Guard-Melee.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Abaddon's Guard Melee</div></div></div>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
